# Docker build konteksti — `Dockerfile` da `COPY . .` turgani uchun bu fayl
# bo'lmasa butun ishchi papka image ichiga ko'chadi (A1a).
#
# Eng muhimi tezlik emas, **sirlar**: `.env.local` ichida haqiqiy
# `GEMINI_API_KEY` va `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN` bor va ular image qatlamida
# abadiy qolib ketardi — image'ni kim olsa, kalitlarni ham oladi.

# --- Sirlar va muhit ---
# `**` majburiy: production env `deploy/.env` ichida, rootda emas.
# Sirlar COPY qatlamiga kirib, keyin o'chirilishi ham xavfsiz emas.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# --- Lokal ma'lumot: image ichiga tushmasligi shart ---
db.sqlite3
db.sqlite3-journal
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
test_db.sqlite3
media/
private-media/
**/backups/

# --- Virtual muhit va kesh ---
venv/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- Git va IDE ---
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
.codex
.antigravityignore

# --- Build natijalari (image ichida `collectstatic` qayta yugurtiriladi) ---
staticfiles/

# --- Hujjat va ishchi materiallar (runtime uchun kerak emas) ---
nuclear-program/
playground/
images/
*.md
!README.md

# --- Loglar va vaqtinchalik fayllar ---
*.log
scripts/
